    "amendment": {
      "type": "sharedContract.fieldAdd",
      "contractId": "sc3",
      "breaking": false,
      "field": {
        "name": "BoardUpMessage 'show-more' variant",
        "optional": false,
        "type": "{ readonly type: 'show-more'; readonly stage: DeliveryStage }",
        "purpose": "Lets the reader reveal the next page of one board column; the host validates the stage id and raises that column's visible limit (sc5 hiddenCount)."
      }
    },
    "rationale": "sc5 gives each column cards (the shown page) and hiddenCount (the rest behind show-more), and s2's boundary pages each column, but sc3's up-messages have no intent that asks for the next page. One additive variant naming only a stage id keeps up-messages id-only and lets the host keep paging state; nothing existing changes.",
